+    // flash_attn_dpas: prompt attention (f32 Q, f16 K/V, head size 256) on
+    // the XMX units. SG 16 (Xe2): 128 query rows and 32 keys a step
+    // (measured-here, test-backend-ops, 512 rows x 4,096 keys, 24 heads on
